# The sketch kept apart: `run_stored` is a prophecy that supersedes `run`, and it builds the prophetized `Store` and
# writes the report to it. No built code calls it; what it runs is sketch, with no effect yet.

route archive.app.run_stored
step run_stored/Store()
step run_stored/Store.write

line entry > run_stored call
line run_stored/Store() > Store@run_stored/Store() value
line Store@run_stored/Store() > run_stored/Store.write value    # the Store it built is what write runs on

home Store@run_stored/Store() run_stored

side entry left
